ing  farm but if he feels like a cool  refreshing dip who doesn't have to go  far  the houseboat was built in Dresden at a  cost of 400 thousand euros and then  shipped to Berlin but that wasn't the  only obstacle Harald had to overcome the  toughest challenge for a houseboat owner  is to find a mooring they are in short  supply in Berlin and almost impossible  to come by right now Harald has found  one but he'd much rather be anchored in  the middle of the river friends can use  the dinghy when they visit the terrace  is the perfect place for a barbecue on  warm summer evenings I really enjoy  being on board this boat whatever the  weather it's simply perfect  time to raise their glasses to the host  powered wind lers floating home is the  perfect place to get away from the  hustle and bustle of life on land in the  city
 

